      "number": 1,
      "question": "60% of 40% of 150% of 52 = ?",
      "questionHtml": "60% of 40% of 150% of 52 = ?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "20.21",
          "html": "20.21"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "18.72",
          "html": "18.72"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "17.78",
          "html": "17.78"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "24.23",
          "html": "24.23"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>Using BODMAS , simplifying 60% of 40% of 150% of 52</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 60% of 40% of 150% of 52</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 60/100 of 40/100 of 150/100 of 52</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 60/100 &times; 40/100 &times; 150/100 &times; 52</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; (60 &times; 40 &times; 150 &times; 52)/(100 &times; 100 &times; 100)</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 18720000/1000000</p>\n\n<p>= 18.72</p>\n",
      "images": [],
