      "id": "707fed6a1ac7-q4",
      "number": 4,
      "question": "Find the value of 25% of \\(16\\frac{2}{3}\\) % of Rs. 4800.",
      "questionHtml": "Find the value of 25% of <span class=\"math-tex\">\\(16\\frac{2}{3}\\)</span>% of Rs. 4800.",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Rs. 2",
          "html": "Rs.&nbsp;2&nbsp;"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Rs. 2000",
          "html": "Rs.&nbsp;2000&nbsp;"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Rs. 200",
          "html": "Rs.&nbsp;200"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Rs. 20",
          "html": "Rs.&nbsp;20&nbsp;"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p><b>Calculation:</b></p>\n\n<p>25% of&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(16\\frac{2}{3}\\)</span>% of Rs. 4800</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; (25/100)&nbsp;&times; (50/300)&nbsp;&times; Rs. 4800</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; Rs. (4800/24) = Rs. 200</p>\n\n<p><strong>&there4; The required value is Rs. 200.</strong></p>\n",
