      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "707fed6a1ac7-q5",
      "number": 5,
      "question": "Solve the following question 15% of 1,500 + 1,600 &times; 12.5% - 62.5% of 400?",
      "questionHtml": "Solve the following question 15% of 1,500 + 1,600 &times; 12.5% - 62.5% of 400?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "225",
          "html": "225"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "175",
          "html": "175"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "125",
          "html": "125"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "185",
          "html": "185"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p><strong>Given:</strong></p>\n\n<p>15% of 1,500 + 1,600 &times; 12.5% - 62.5% of 400</p>\n\n<p><strong>Concept used:</strong></p>\n\n<p>Follow the BODMAS rule according to the table given below.</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/20/12/Uploading_Neelima_Quant_assignment_50_ques_simplification_and_average_20_dec.docx_1.PNG\" style=\"width: 427px; height: 232px;\" /></p>\n\n<p><strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p>15% of 1,500 + 1,600 &times; 12.5% - 62.5% of 400</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; (15 / 100) &times; 1,500 + (1,600 &times; 1 / 8) - (5 / 8 &times; 400)&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>[12.5% = 1 / 8] [62.5% = 5 / 8]</strong></p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 225 + 200 - 250</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 425 - 250</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 175</p>\n",
      "images": [
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/20/12/Uploading_Neelima_Quant_assignment_50_ques_simplification_and_average_20_dec.docx_1.PNG"
      ],
