      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "707fed6a1ac7-q6",
      "number": 6,
      "question": "(980 of 12%) - (450 of ? %)= 227 of 30%",
      "questionHtml": "(980 of 12%) - (450 of ? %)= 227 of 30%",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "13",
          "html": "13"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "9",
          "html": "9"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "10",
          "html": "10"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "11",
          "html": "11"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p><span style=\"display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;\"><img height=\"26px\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/shortcut-trick-image.png\" width=\"26px\" /> <u style=\"font-size: 21px; font-weight: 700; display: inline !important;\">Shortcut Trick</u></span>\n<p>Given equation: 12% of 980 − x% of 450 = 30% of 227</p>\n<p>⇒ 117.6 − 4.5x = 68.1</p>\n<p>⇒ 4.5x = 117.6 − 68.1 = 49.5</p>\n<p>⇒ x = 49.5 ÷ 4.5 = 11</p>\n<p><strong>∴ The correct answer is 11.</strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;\"><img height=\"26px\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/alternate-methord-image.png\" width=\"26px\" /><strong><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;\"><u>Alternate Method</u></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><strong>Given:</strong></p>\n<p>(12% of 980) − (?% of 450) = (30% of 227)</p>\n<p><strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n<p>Let the unknown value be x.</p>\n<p>⇒ [12 ÷ 100 × 980] − [x ÷ 100 × 450] = [30 ÷ 100 × 227]</p>\n<p>⇒ [12 × 9.8] − [x × 4.5] = [3 × 22.7]</p>\n<p>⇒ 117.6 − 4.5x = 68.1</p>\n<p>⇒ 4.5x = 117.6 − 68.1</p>\n<p>⇒ 4.5x = 49.5</p>\n<p>⇒ x = 49.5 ÷ 4.5</p>\n<p>⇒ x = 495 ÷ 45</p>\n<p>⇒ x = 11</p>\n<p><strong>∴ The correct answer is 11.</strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;\"><img height=\"26px\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/additional-information-image.png\" width=\"26px\" /><strong><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;\"><u>Additional Information</u></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin:8px 0 2px 0;font-weight:700;color:#222222;\">BODMAS Rule</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;color:#444444;\">Always follow the BODMAS rule (Brackets, Order/Of, Division, Multiplication, Addition, Subtraction) systematically to ensure mathematical accuracy in simplification.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:8px 0 2px 0;font-weight:700;color:#222222;\">Percentage Shortcuts</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;color:#444444;\">Remember that x% of y is exactly the same as y% of x. For example, 12% of 980 can also be solved as 98% of 120, which is logically equivalent and sometimes easier to compute.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:8px 0 2px 0;font-weight:700;color:#222222;\">Handling Decimals in Division</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;color:#444444;\">When dividing two numbers that have the same number of decimal places (e.g., 49.5 ÷ 4.5), simply ignore the decimal point and divide the whole numbers (495 ÷ 45) to quickly find the result.</p></p>",
      "images": [
        "//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/shortcut-trick-image.png",
        "//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/alternate-methord-image.png",
        "//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/additional-information-image.png"
      ],
