      "id": "707fed6a1ac7-q8",
      "number": 8,
      "question": "25% of 66.67% of 75% of 80% of a number is 6347. Find 40% of that number.",
      "questionHtml": "25% of 66.67% of 75% of 80% of a number is 6347. Find 40% of that number.&nbsp;",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "24388",
          "html": "24388"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "23388",
          "html": "23388"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "25388",
          "html": "25388"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "26388",
          "html": "26388"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p><strong>Given:</strong></p>\n\n<p>Percentage values: 25%, 66.67%, 75%, 80%</p>\n\n<p><strong>Solution:</strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">Let &quot;x&quot; be the unknown number.</span></p>\n\n<p>25% of 66.67% of 75% of 80% of x = 6347</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; [(25/100) &times; (66.67/100) &times; (75/100) &times; (80/100)] &times; x = 6347</p>\n\n<p>&rArr;&nbsp;<span style=\"\">[(1/4)&nbsp;&times;</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;(2/3)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">&times;</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;(3/4)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">&times;</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;(4/5]&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">&times;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">x = 6347</span></p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 1/10 &times; x = 6347</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; x = 63470</p>\n\n<p>40% of the number x = (40/100) &times;&nbsp;63470</p>\n\n<p>&rArr;&nbsp;2/5&nbsp;&times; <span style=\"\">63470</span></p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 25388</p>\n\n<p><strong>Therefore, 40% of the unknown number is 25388.</strong></p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
