      "solution": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">60% of 400 + k% of 280 = 296</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ (6 × 40) + (</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{k}{100}\\)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> × 280) = 296 ⇒ <span class=\"math-tex\">\\(​​\\frac{k}{10}\\)</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> × 28 = 296 - 240 ⇒ k = 560/28 = 20</span></p>\n",
