      "solution": "<p><strong>Given:</strong></p>\n\n<p>22% of x = 30% of y</p>\n\n<p><strong>Formula:</strong></p>\n\n<p>x% of y = y &times; (x/100)</p>\n\n<p><strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p>22% of x = 30% of y</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; x&nbsp;&times; (22/100) = y&nbsp;&times; (30/100)</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; x/y = 30/22</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; y/x = 22/30</p>\n\n<p>&there4; y : x = 11 : 15</p>\n",
